      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks much for your invaluable input. I feel like this is understood well enough now so that we could try implementing this in Gerrit (hooking in our own SigningKeyDatabase). To conclude this discussion I summarised the findings in a feature request [1]. I\u0027m not sure if/when we will pick it up, but I like that we clarified this enough, so that we could start working on this any time.\n\n[1] https://g-issues.gerritcodereview.com/issues/434664943",
